# #5841, part 1 of the fix removed. Red outside pre-arm too: an idle duplicate (one that
# never wrote, so never claimed) claims after the close.
MODULE: HandOffBoundClaimIgnoresSplitSequence
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an idle duplicate claims after the split's row write and is not marked stale: the eager residual of #5841
PERTURBS: DupClaim
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ IF rowSeq > 0
       THEN /\ dst' = "stale"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the claim does not check the split sequence.
    /\ IF FALSE
       THEN /\ dst' = "stale"
--- END
